            "styles": [],
            "text": "The fuel dock and the slipway will be closed on Monday for dredging. Boats on the outer pontoon should move to the visitor berths by Sunday evening. The office stays open for keys and payments, and the harbormaster can be reached on channel 12 during the works. We expect normal service from Tuesday morning."
          }
        ],
